{"title":"Euc20191/Sub-Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euc20191/Sub-Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/3/3d34631d56f8900e2ca0ba26964f1eaefd9bf0ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3&lt;\\frac{24}{a}&lt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euc20191/Sub-Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa5507ab5a3d1f06941dabd1c26505d646367983.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/8/018d3b3824114748283e2e3993adfebdab422b3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{6}=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" /> and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/a/c1a0caf28dae25372408593f2d14ca238035568c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=8$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/02797b8302657393c12e206d1fd2d33d93db756a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{8}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> has to be between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and therefore, it has to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/1/94152541528ed008abea53ff30e18a07a3c37f51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018083630\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 39/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1744/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:34445:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018083630 and revision id 285360. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}